t window, which expired at almost the same instant.\n\nThis is a known, recurring issue, not new. The ledger documents the identical mechanism at least twice before in this same ledger file (line 1605, and again similarly at line 2619): a metrics-send attempt starts just before/at the DPC network switch, binds to the pre-switch route/IP, and blocks for the full 120s HTTP client timeout before failing, missing the test's 2-minute `LastProcessedConfig` wait by mere seconds. No other failure in this run shares this exact root cause (the other `TestDeviceConnectivitySuite` failures in run #21's PNAC/DNS entries are unrelated mechanisms). No PR diff was provided for this investigation, so no RELATED verdict is given.","time":{"start":1794956922000,"stop":1794957362500,"duration":440500}},{"uid":"dbbbd3fc81bb502","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/21/#testresult/dbbbd3fc81bb502","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794868973000,"stop":1794869187530,"duration":214530}},{"uid":"bd113d9453f0a816","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/20/#testresult/bd113d9453f0a816","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794783243000,"stop":1794783456470,"duration":213470}},{"uid":"28adfd45146f878b","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/18/#testresult/28adfd45146f878b","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794693784000,"stop":1794693982170,"duration":198170}},{"uid":"9a0f0c07ef047a74","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/17/#testresult/9a0f0c07ef047a74","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794607836000,"stop":1794608025360,"duration":189360}},{"uid":"413a396c26c14e8d","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/16/#testresult/413a396c26c14e8d","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794522238000,"stop":1794522441060,"duration":203060}},{"uid":"53addc85934d84b4","reportUrl":"https://lf-edge.github.io/eve/test/master/runs/15/#testresult/53addc85934d84b4","status":"passed","time":{"start":1794438463000,"